{{ :media:dlink:dlink_dwr960_side.png?200|D-Link DWR-960}}

The D-Link DWR-960 Wireless Router is based on the MT7620A SoC. It has a 802.11bgn (SoC-integrated) and a 802.11a/ac (Mediatek MT7610E) radios. The router has five Ethernet ports: one 1Gbit (LAN) and four 100Mbit ports (1 WAN and 3 LAN). DWR-960 is equipped in LTE QMI modem cat 6.


